{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774055230702,"story":{"title":"Gus the Great and the Happy Hues","userPrompt":"I want a strong gorilla and monkeys that are happy","authorStyleId":"eric-carle","readingLevel":"early","illustrationStyleId":"collage_mixed","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Gus was a great gorilla. He was big and strong. But Gus was sad. He saw gray, gray trees. He saw gray, gray rocks. He wanted happy colors!","illustrationPrompt":"Gus, a large but gentle-looking gorilla with a slightly frowning expression, stands amidst a gray forest. The trees and rocks are monotone gray. Background is muted. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: mostly grays with a hint of green.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1773667460711,"durationMs":6685,"retries":0,"promptLength":553,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A large Dark gray fur with a silver back gorilla, Medium Deep brown eyes with sad expression, Large, expressive eyebrows, Slightly protruding lower lip, Small scar above his left eye, Large, gentle hands, Stocky and muscular build. Gus stands dejected in a gray jungle clearing, looking at gray trees and rocks. in Jungle Clearing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 2, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"Gus went to the monkeys. The monkeys were happy. They swung in the trees. \"Can you help me?\" asked Gus. \"I want happy colors!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Gus, looking slightly hopeful, approaches a group of three cheerful monkeys swinging from gray tree branches. The monkeys have wide smiles. Background is still mostly gray. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Primarily gray with the monkeys having slightly brighter fur.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1773667489260,"durationMs":7690,"retries":0,"promptLength":794,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A large Dark gray fur with a silver back gorilla, Medium Deep brown eyes with hopeful expression, Large, expressive eyebrows, Slightly protruding lower lip, Small scar above his left eye, Large, gentle hands, Stocky and muscular build. A small Light brown fur with tan faces and hands monkey, Small, lively Bright amber eyes with happy expression, Long, prehensile tails, Large, floppy ears, Playful grins, Bushy eyebrows, Slim and agile build. Gus approaches a group of monkeys swinging in the trees, asking for help. in Jungle Clearing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 2, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"The monkeys said, \"We can paint!\" They found berries. Red berries! Blue berries! Yellow berries! The monkeys mixed and mashed.","illustrationPrompt":"Three monkeys are happily mashing berries of red, blue, and yellow in small stone bowls. Gus watches with interest. Background starting to show hints of green. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Introduction of bright red, blue, and yellow. Overall background still muted.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772980220661,"durationMs":5317,"retries":0,"promptLength":509,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A small Light brown fur with tan faces and hands monkey, Small, lively Bright amber eyes with excited expression, Long, prehensile tails, Large, floppy ears, Playful grins, Bushy eyebrows, Slim and agile build. The monkeys gather berries of different colors (red, blue, yellow) and begin to mash them. in Jungle Clearing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"They mixed red and yellow. They made orange! They mixed blue and yellow. They made green! The monkeys made new colors!","illustrationPrompt":"Close-up of the berry mixtures. One bowl contains orange paint, another contains green paint. The monkeys look proud of their creations. Gus is watching closely. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Focus on bright orange and green, with red, blue, and yellow still visible.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772980224685,"durationMs":4032,"retries":0,"promptLength":511,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A small Light brown fur with tan faces and hands monkey, Small, lively Bright amber eyes with amazed expression, Long, prehensile tails, Large, floppy ears, Playful grins, Bushy eyebrows, Slim and agile build. The monkeys mix red and yellow berries to create orange, and blue and yellow to create green. in Jungle Clearing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Gus used a big leaf. He dipped it in the paint. He painted a rock. The rock was green! He painted a tree. The tree was orange!","illustrationPrompt":"Gus is using a large leaf like a paintbrush to paint a rock bright green. He's smiling slightly. A nearby tree has orange paint on its trunk. The monkeys are cheering him on. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Dominance of green and orange, with hints of other colors starting to appear in the background.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772980224623,"durationMs":3962,"retries":0,"promptLength":520,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A large Dark gray fur with a silver back gorilla, Medium Deep brown eyes with determined expression, Large, expressive eyebrows, Slightly protruding lower lip, Small scar above his left eye, Large, gentle hands, Stocky and muscular build. Gus uses a large leaf as a brush to paint a rock green and a tree orange. in Jungle Clearing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"The monkeys painted too! They painted flowers. The flowers were blue and red. They painted butterflies. The butterflies were yellow!","illustrationPrompt":"The monkeys are painting flowers with blue and red berries. Butterflies with yellow markings flutter around them. Gus is watching them with a smile. The background is becoming more colorful. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Expanding to include bright blues, reds, and yellows, adding to the vibrancy.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772980477824,"durationMs":6205,"retries":0,"promptLength":515,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A small Light brown fur with tan faces and hands monkey, Small, lively Bright amber eyes with joyful expression, Long, prehensile tails, Large, floppy ears, Playful grins, Bushy eyebrows, Slim and agile build. The monkeys paint flowers blue and red, and butterflies yellow. in Jungle Clearing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"Gus painted the sky. He made it bright blue. The monkeys laughed. They made the sun yellow. Everything was happy and bright!","illustrationPrompt":"Gus is painting the sky a bright blue. The monkeys have painted a cheerful yellow sun. Everyone is smiling and laughing. The forest is now filled with color. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: Full range of bright, cheerful colors, creating a vibrant and happy scene.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772980230792,"durationMs":6168,"retries":0,"promptLength":722,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A large Dark gray fur with a silver back gorilla, Medium Deep brown eyes with happy expression, Large, expressive eyebrows, Slightly protruding lower lip, Small scar above his left eye, Large, gentle hands, Stocky and muscular build. A small Light brown fur with tan faces and hands monkey, Small, lively Bright amber eyes with playful expression, Long, prehensile tails, Large, floppy ears, Playful grins, Bushy eyebrows, Slim and agile build. Gus paints the sky bright blue, and the monkeys paint the sun yellow. in Jungle Clearing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"Gus was happy. The monkeys were happy. The forest was full of color. They all made art together. It was a happy day!","illustrationPrompt":"Gus and the monkeys are all gathered together, smiling and surrounded by their colorful art. The forest is a vibrant and joyful place. They are holding paint covered leaves. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: A celebration of all the colors, creating a feeling of warmth and friendship.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1773667521615,"durationMs":8060,"retries":0,"promptLength":813,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A large Dark gray fur with a silver back gorilla, Medium Deep brown eyes with happy expression, Large, expressive eyebrows, Slightly protruding lower lip, Small scar above his left eye, Large, gentle hands, Stocky and muscular build. A small Light brown fur with tan faces and hands monkey, Small, lively Bright amber eyes with happy expression, 